usands place:** \\(6 + 9 = 15\\).\n  - Write down **5** and carry over **1**.\n  .\n- **Hundred-thousands place:** \\(3 + 9 = 12\\).\n  - Add the carried-over **1** to get **13**.\n  - Write down **13**.\n\n3. **Combine all the results:**.\n\n```.\n    13.\n  5 5.\n    8 5.\n    6 5.\n  3 6 3.\n+9 7 2.\n---------.\n1 3 3 5 8 5 6.\n```.\n\n**Final Answer:**.\n\n\\[. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
